.\" excerpt: util-linux su(1), Debian trixie; no Generator line
.TH SU 1
.SH NAME
su \- run a command with substitute user
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
.B -c , --command
.I command
.RS 4
Pass command to the shell with the -c option.
.RE
.PP
.B - , -l , --login
.RS 4
Start a login shell.
.PP
.RS 4
\(buclears all environment variables except TERM.
.RE
.RE
.PP
.B --session-command=\fIcommand\fR
.RS 4
Do not create a new session.
.RE
.PP
.B --
.RS 4
End the command-line options.
.RE
